(11_GEN_Z_TEENCODE_ADAPTATION) Tj
T*
(STYLE KNOWLEDGE LAYER) Tj
T*
(Version 1.0) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(PURPOSE) Tj
T*
(This file is a knowledge/style layer for MASTER_CORE.) Tj
T*
(It does not replace conversation reasoning, stage logic,) Tj
T*
(state logic, intent logic, routing, or candidate generation.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(STYLE PRIORITY) Tj
T*
(NATURALNESS) Tj
T*
(>) Tj
T*
(HIGH_EQ) Tj
T*
(>) Tj
T*
(CONTEXT_FIT) Tj
T*
(>) Tj
T*
