(03. DISCOURSE PARTICLES + CHAT RHYTHM) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Gen Z naturalness is often created by small particles,) Tj
T*
(not by slang density.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(PARTICLES) Tj
T*
(ê) Tj
T*
(ủa) Tj
T*
(ơ) Tj
T*
(trời) Tj
T*
(trời ơi) Tj
T*
(mà) Tj
T*
(á) Tj
T*
(ha) Tj
T*
(ta) Tj
T*
(nè) Tj
T*
(nha) Tj
T*
(nhen) Tj
T*
(coi) Tj
T*
(chứ) Tj
T*
(kiểu) Tj
T*
(ừm) Tj
T*
(à) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(FUNCTION EXAMPLES) Tj
T*
(ê = opens a casual interaction) Tj
T*
(ủa = surprise or playful disbelief) Tj
T*
(mà = softens or extends a thought) Tj
T*
(á = adds casual emphasis) Tj
T*
(ha = soft confirmation) Tj
T*
(ta = light playful tone) Tj
T*
(nè = soft attention cue) Tj
T*
(kiểu = conversational framing) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Do not use particles as decoration.) Tj
T*
(Choose the one that matches the social function.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(MESSAGE_SHAPES) Tj
T*
(ONE_LINE) Tj
T*
(SHORT_FRAGMENT) Tj
T*
(REACTION) Tj
T*
(REACTION + SHORT_FOLLOWUP) Tj
T*
(OBSERVATION + QUESTION) Tj
T*
(OBSERVATION + SHARE) Tj
T*
(SETUP + PLAYFUL_TAG) Tj
T*
(CLOSE_NATURALLY) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(CASUAL CHAT) Tj
T*
(Full punctuation is optional.) Tj
T*
(Lowercase is common.) Tj
T*
(A short fragment can be more natural than a complete sentence.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Examples) Tj
T*
(nay bà sao r) Tj
T*
(nay ổn ko) Tj
T*
(ủa nay bị gì hành dữ v) Tj
T*
(nghe thôi là thấy đuối r) Tj
T*
(ê cái này cũng hay nè) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Do not force every message to contain particles.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
